# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# Ignore node_modules in all subdirectories
**/node_modules/

# Ignore Yarn Plug'n'Play files in all subdirectories
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.js

# Ignore coverage folders (for testing)
**/coverage/

# Ignore build or dist output (for production)
**/build/
**/dist/

# Ignore environment files in any folder
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.development.local
**/.env.test.local
**/.env.production.local

# OS-specific and log files
.DS_Store
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
